      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 3 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 2\\leq N\\leq 1000; 1\\leq M\\leq N/2; 0\\leq A _ {i,j}\\leq10 ^ 9; All input values are integers."
